         "Quantitative research cheezon ko numbers mein measure karti hai (surveys, experiments, statistics) aur relationships ya hypotheses test karti hai. Qualitative research alfaaz mein meanings aur experiences explore karti hai (interviews, focus groups, observation) aur understanding banati hai. Bohat si studies dono ko mix karti hain. Apne research question ke mutabiq choose karein, fashion ke mutabiq nahi.",
